### =========================================================================
### Employee Management & Leave Workflow Platform - HTTP Requests
### Compatible with IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client & VS Code REST Client
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Public Registration (Safely defaults to ROLE_EMPLOYEE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Charlie",
  "lastName": "Brown",
  "email": "charlie.dev@company.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "jobTitle": "Associate Software Engineer",
  "departmentId": 1
}

### 2. Login as Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin@company.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### Store Token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3. Login as Manager John
# @name managerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manager.john@company.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### Store Token
@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Login as Employee Alice
# @name aliceLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice.dev@company.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### Store Token
@aliceToken = {{aliceLogin.response.body.token}}

### =========================================================================
### Employee & Department APIs
### =========================================================================

### 5. Get Alice's Own Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/me
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 6. Get Alice's Balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/3/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 7. Manager John views Alice's profile (Authorized: Alice reports to John)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/3
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 8. Alice tries to view Bob's profile (Forbidden IDOR: returns 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/4
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 9. Admin creates a new Department
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "FIN",
  "name": "Finance & Accounting",
  "description": "Financial planning, audit, and tax operations",
  "active": true
}

### 10. List Active Departments (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments?page=0&size=10&sort=name,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### =========================================================================
### Leave Management Workflow
### =========================================================================

### 11. Alice Submits a Leave Request (5 working days, excluding weekends)
# @name submitLeave
POST {{baseUrl}}/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaveType": "ANNUAL",
  "startDate": "2026-11-09",
  "endDate": "2026-11-13",
  "reason": "Family vacation abroad"
}

### Store Leave ID
@leaveId = {{submitLeave.response.body.id}}

### 12. Alice views her submitted leave requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves/my-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 13. Manager John views his team's pending queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves/manager-queue?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 14. Manager John Approves Alice's Leave (Atomically deducts balance)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/leaves/{{leaveId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comments": "Approved. Have a great vacation, Alice!"
}

### 15. View Leave Request Workflow Audit History
GET {{baseUrl}}/leaves/{{leaveId}}/audits
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### 16. Alice Cancels her future approved leave (Atomically restores balance)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/leaves/{{leaveId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comments": "Flight cancelled, restoring leave days"
}
